{"seq":4,"slug":"working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents","title":"Working In A Monorepo With Agents","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scoping-agent-work-to-packages","title":"把 Agent 的工作圈定到包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/scoping-agent-work-to-packages","wordCount":1874,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-package-changes","title":"跨包改动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/cross-package-changes","wordCount":1998,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"context-and-conventions-at-scale","title":"规模下的上下文与约定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/context-and-conventions-at-scale","wordCount":1994,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲在 monorepo 里实际与 agent 协作的方法:把 agent 的工作圈定到一个包(或少数几个),让它在可控的范围内工作、不必装下整个仓库;处理跨包改动时把握好顺序、契约、影响传播,让原本风险高的跨包改动也可控;以及在规模下经营上下文与约定——用分层的、就近的上下文(根级 + 各包级 AGENTS.md)和一致的约定,让 agent 在巨大的仓库里始终读到与它当前工作相关的那部分。</p>\n"}